[E-MAIN-TYPE] Error: `main` must have type `() -> {IO} ()` or `() -> {IO} ExitStatus`, with any of `Fail`, `Files` and `Partial` added to the row
   ╭─[ main-type.sw:4:1 ]
   │
 4 │ def main () : {IO, Abort} () := abort ()
   │ ──────────────┬─────────────  
   │               ╰─────────────── this has type `() → {IO, Abort} ()`
   │ 
   │ Note: for example `() -> {Files, IO, Fail} ()`, or `() -> {IO} ExitStatus` to choose the exit status; a pure `main: () -> ()` is allowed too; other abilities must be handled inside `main`
